	(text "ANALOG POWER + FAIL-SAFE AFE ENABLE (hardware, firmware-independent)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73f0ad88-cdeb-51dc-8ed8-58a5a87972a7")
	)
	(text "VBAT STAR (RB-00.6): VBAT splits AT the J1 pin-1 pad. Burst branch -> XIAO BAT+ post (sheet XIAO_Brain_Interface, U1 pad 23);\nAFE branch -> R4001. The two branches share no copper beyond the pad (layout rule, RB-02)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cd82590f-7b8c-559d-9927-fe3294f510c8")
	)
	(text "DESIGN INTENT (this sheet):\n- VBAT (J1) -> R4001 4.7 ohm -> C4007 22 uF -> TPS7A2030P -> AFE_3V0. VBAT star at J1 pin 1 (RB-00.6).\n- AFE_EN: D3 -> R3007 10k; R3008 100k pull-down; Q3001 2N7002 drain pulls EN low whenever XIAO 5V (VBUS) is present.\n- R3009 4.7k load on XIAO 5V defeats XIAO D2 Schottky leakage (RB-00.5). No Q3002 / R3005 (TPS7A2030P active discharge)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cfe8f3d4-6024-57e0-b85b-1c6408aaf519")
	)
	(text "HARDWARE USB INHIBIT (RB-00 / RB-00.6 frozen): AFE_EN = AFE_EN_REQ AND NOT VBUS\n- D3 high, no USB: AFE_EN ~ 2.95 V (10k / 100k||500k) -> LDO ON\n- USB present: Q3001 on -> AFE_EN ~ 1 mV regardless of D3 (D3 current limited by R3007 10k) -> LDO OFF\n- XIAO absent / unpowered / reset / crashed (D3 Hi-Z or 0 V): R3008 100k (+ internal 500k) -> AFE_EN = 0 V -> LDO OFF\n- XIAO absent: R3004 holds VBUS_GATE low; R3009 holds XIAO_5V low. D6/USB_PRESENT is NOT in this path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f71d9740-6f91-58fb-be5a-82561f70696e")
	)
